                    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"Recipe","name":"Tvarohov\u00e9 knedl\u00ed\u010dky s\u00a0bor\u016fvkov\u00fdm rozvarem podle Romana Pauluse","description":"Ovocn\u00e9 knedl\u00edky jsou p\u00fdchou na\u0161\u00ed kuchyn\u011b i ozdobou l\u00e9ta. T\u011bst i n\u00e1pln\u00ed je bezpo\u010det variant a ka\u017ed\u00fd m\u00e1 r\u00e1d tu svou. Nebo n\u011bkolik t\u011bch sv\u00fdch. Tady jsme si recept vyp\u016fj\u010dili od michelinsk\u00e9ho \u0161\u00e9fkucha\u0159e Romana Pauluse, ale nam\u00edsto pln\u011bn\u00ed ovocem jsme pro zjednodu\u0161en\u00ed zvolili bor\u016fvkov\u00fd rozvar, po starod\u00e1vnu zvan\u00fd \u017eahour. ","url":"https:\/\/fresh.iprima.cz\/recepty\/tvarohove-knedlicky-s-boruvkovym-rozvarem-podle-romana-pauluse","datePublished":"2026-08-12T09:35:00+02:00","mainEntityOfPage":"https:\/\/fresh.iprima.cz\/recepty\/tvarohove-knedlicky-s-boruvkovym-rozvarem-podle-romana-pauluse","dateModified":"2026-08-12T09:35:00+02:00","publisher":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"FTV Prima","url":"https:\/\/fresh.iprima.cz","email":"online@iprima.cz","logo":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"ImageObject","url":"\/images\/logo-bg.jpg","width":800,"height":424,"caption":"Prima Fresh","creditText":"FTV Prima","copyrightNotice":"FTV Prima","creator":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"FTV Prima"},"license":"https:\/\/www.iprima.cz\/vseobecne-podminky","acquireLicensePage":"https:\/\/www.iprima.cz\/vseobecne-podminky"},"sameAs":["https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/PrimaFresh.cz","https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/primafresh\/"],"alternateName":["Prima Fresh","Fresh Prima","Fresh"]},"copyrightYear":"2026","author":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"redakce Prima FRESH","description":null,"url":""},"image":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn.administrace.tv\/2022\/08\/07\/small_169\/fbecda9325c39a3d938621f3d27ff26f.jpg","width":800,"height":450,"caption":"Tvarohov\u00e9 knedl\u00ed\u010dky s bor\u016fvkov\u00fdm rozvarem podle Romana Pauluse","creditText":"L.A. CREATIVE FOOD","copyrightNotice":"L.A. CREATIVE FOOD","creator":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"L.A. CREATIVE FOOD"},"license":"https:\/\/www.iprima.cz\/vseobecne-podminky","acquireLicensePage":"https:\/\/www.iprima.cz\/vseobecne-podminky"},"recipeCuisine":"czech","recipeIngredient":["500 g (2 kostky) tvaroh, polo- nebo plnotu\u010dn\u00fd ","140 g d\u011btsk\u00e1 krupi\u010dka","140 g hladk\u00e1 mouka","140 g m\u00e1slo, zm\u011bkl\u00e9 ","2 ks vejce","1 s\u00e1\u010dek vanilkov\u00fd cukr","z 1 citronu citronov\u00e1 k\u016fra, nastrouhan\u00e1 ","1 \u0161petka s\u016fl","500 g bor\u016fvky","1 l\u017e\u00edce m\u00e1slo","50 g cukr krupice","1 l\u017ei\u010dka bramborov\u00fd \u0161krob","250 ml smetana na va\u0159en\u00ed, nebo plnotu\u010dn\u00e9 ml\u00e9ko"],"keywords":["tvaroh","d\u011btsk\u00e1 krupi\u010dka","hladk\u00e1 mouka","m\u00e1slo","vejce","vanilkov\u00fd cukr","citronov\u00e1 k\u016fra","s\u016fl","bor\u016fvky","m\u00e1slo","cukr krupice","bramborov\u00fd \u0161krob","smetana na va\u0159en\u00ed"],"totalTime":"PT1H0M0S","aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":4.5999999999999996447286321199499070644378662109375,"ratingCount":46},"recipeCategory":"Recepty","recipeInstructions":["<p>Na knedl\u00ed\u010dky ze v\u0161ech surovin vypracujte t\u011bsto (n\u011bkter\u00e9 \u010dten\u00e1\u0159ky rad\u00ed ho nejprve prom\u00edchat metlou a pak prohn\u00edst rukama). Nechte ho odle\u017eet hodinu a\u017e dv\u011b v ledni\u010dce, m\u016f\u017eete a\u017e do druh\u00e9ho dne.<\/p>","<p>Dejte va\u0159it vodu do hrnce, malinko ji osolte. Z t\u011bsta tvarujte mal\u00e9 no\u010dky nebo kuli\u010dky a vhazujte je do vody. Va\u0159te asi 20 minut.<\/p>","<p>Na rozvar dejte do kastrolu o\u010di\u0161t\u011bn\u00e9 bor\u016fvky a p\u0159idejte m\u00e1slo, cukr a tro\u0161ku vody. Va\u0159te asi 10 minut, pot\u00e9 p\u0159ilijte pan\u00e1k studen\u00e9 vody s rozm\u00edchan\u00fdm \u0161krobem a kr\u00e1tce prova\u0159te. Nakonec p\u0159ilijte smetanu, prom\u00edchejte a pod\u00e1vejte.<\/p>","<p>Knedl\u00ed\u010dky rozd\u011blte na tal\u00ed\u0159e a p\u0159elijte rozvarem.<\/p>"]}</script>
